      "cooked": "<p>I just got an email from Handelabra games announcing lots of cool things!</p>\n<p>I noticed it the body of the email it lists the powers of the Termination heroes and Unity’s power was listed as:</p>\n<p>Shuffle a Mechanical Golem in play into your deck… etc.</p>\n<p>I thought the power first destroyed a Mechanical Golem and then shuffled it into your deck…</p>\n<p>So typo, or change… or am I just going crazy and it always worked like that?</p>",
